# ─── Build output & packaged artifact (regenerated by scripts\build.ps1) ───
/build/
/dist/AmissProj.jar

# The jars in dist/lib/ ARE committed on purpose so the project is clone-and-run.
# All three are freely redistributable:
#   AbsoluteLayout.jar       - NetBeans, CDDL/GPLv2+CPE
#   beansbinding-1.2.1.jar   - LGPL/BSD
#   mysql-connector-j-*.jar  - GPLv2 + FOSS exception (Community build from Maven Central)

# ─── NetBeans per-user state (machine-specific, not portable) ───
/nbproject/private/

# ─── Secrets (none today, but never commit these) ───
*.env
secrets.properties

# ─── IDE / editor / OS cruft ───
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
